==The Draft==
{{#ev:youtube|RQzaWVa8-t4|280}}

==Format==
* Games will be played on European servers. 
* Group stage: {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}} maps; first to win 2 maps wins. You get 1 point for a map win.
* Playoff stage: {{abbr|BO5|Best of 5}} maps; where #1 play #4, #2 play #3.

